   "text": "FIX: smaller block size (or finer blocks)\nbounds waste to < P per sequence\ntrade-off: more blocks, more metadata",
   "originalText": "FIX: smaller block size (or finer blocks)\nbounds waste to < P per sequence\ntrade-off: more blocks, more metadata",
