   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1) allocate bigger region   2) copy existing KV   3) free old region\ncopy volume = T x 2 L H_kv d_h S = T x 128 KiB (Llama-3-8B)\nT = 8192  ->  8192 x 128 KiB = 1 GiB moved while decoding",
   "originalText": "1) allocate bigger region   2) copy existing KV   3) free old region\ncopy volume = T x 2 L H_kv d_h S = T x 128 KiB (Llama-3-8B)\nT = 8192  ->  8192 x 128 KiB = 1 GiB moved while decoding",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
