   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Key insight: KV grows by allocating another page, not by resizing a contiguous tensor.\nCost of growth: O(1) table append instead of O(T) copy.",
   "originalText": "Key insight: KV grows by allocating another page, not by resizing a contiguous tensor.\nCost of growth: O(1) table append instead of O(T) copy.",
