   "versionNonce": 531836784,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A->[0,3,6]  E->[2,7] C->[1,5]  D->[4]    free list: []",
   "originalText": "A->[0,3,6]  E->[2,7] C->[1,5]  D->[4]    free list: []",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e285",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1450,
   "y": 3018.0,
   "width": 484.0,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1501558974,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1123584174,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "pool = 8 blocks, free list is a stack/queue of IDs\nB done -> refcount(2) = refcount(7) = 0 -> FREE\nE needs ceil(tokens/16) = 2 blocks, free = 2  OK\nE -> [2, 7]  (not adjacent: 2 ... 7)\nA's block table never changed",
   "originalText": "pool = 8 blocks, free list is a stack/queue of IDs\nB done -> refcount(2) = refcount(7) = 0 -> FREE\nE needs ceil(tokens/16) = 2 blocks, free = 2  OK\nE -> [2, 7]  (not adjacent: 2 ... 7)\nA's block table never changed",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e286",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1450,
   "y": 3138.0,
   "width": 826.0000000000001,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
