   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Smaller P: little internal waste, but MORE blocks, bigger block tables, more\nbookkeeping and more indirection in the attention kernel.\nLarger P: fewer blocks, less metadata, more internal waste.",
   "originalText": "Smaller P: little internal waste, but MORE blocks, bigger block tables, more\nbookkeeping and more indirection in the attention kernel.\nLarger P: fewer blocks, less metadata, more internal waste.",
