   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Allocator / kernel co-design: waste bound = (P - 1) tokens x 128 KiB/token\nP = 16: <= 15 x 128 KiB = 1.875 MiB per sequence (Llama-3-8B).",
   "originalText": "Allocator / kernel co-design: waste bound = (P - 1) tokens x 128 KiB/token\nP = 16: <= 15 x 128 KiB = 1.875 MiB per sequence (Llama-3-8B).",
